+14. Scale positions: $\text{poses\_recentered}[:, :3, 3] *= s$ [S1, unofficial].
+15. Update transform: $\text{transform} = \text{diag}(s, s, s, 1) \cdot \text{transform}$ [S1, unofficial].
 
